# Claude Code session state: accumulated per-command allowlists with machine- and
# session-specific absolute paths. Un-ignore settings.json if a curated, shared
# project config is ever worth committing.
.claude/

# View definitions are written atomically: a hidden temp file beside the target
# (.<name>.<pid>.<n>.tmp), then a rename over it. If the process dies between the
# two the temp survives — it should never reach a commit.
.*.tmp
